      en: ["A mountain in the Red Sea State in the northeast.", "Located in the Northeast African state of Sudan.", "The region is shaped by the Nile and the Nubian Desert.", "Climate is mostly hot and dry, with desert and Sahel zones.", "Accessible via the national road network and Nile waterways.", "Connected to the heritage of the ancient Nubian kingdoms of Kush and Meroe."]
